%N A101091 Fourth partial sums of fourth powers (A000583).
%H A101091 Cecilia Rossiter, <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20090428171006/http://noticingnumbers.net/300SeriesCube.htm">Depictions, Explorations and Formulas of the Euler/Pascal Cube</a>.
