%H A101091 <a href="/index/Rec#order_09">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (9,-36,84,-126,126,-84,36,-9,1).
%F A101091 a(n) = n*(1 + n)*(2 + n)^2*(3 + n)*(4 + n)*(-1 + 3*n*(4 + n))/5040.
%F A101091 a(n) = 9*a(n-1)-36*a(n-2)+84*a(n-3)-126*a(n-4)+126*a(n-5)-84*a(n-6)+36*a(n-7)-9*a(n-8)+a(n-9); a(1)=1, a(2)=20, a(3)=155, a(4)=760, a(5)=2814, a(6)=8592, a(7)=22770, a(8)=54120, a(9)=117975. - _Harvey P. Dale_, Dec 30 2011
%F A101091 G.f.: x*(1+x)*(1+10*x+x^2)/(1-x)^9. - _Colin Barker_, Apr 04 2012
%F A101091 Sum_{n>=1} 1/a(n) = 3934693/3380 - 210*Pi^2/13 - (2268/13)*sqrt(3/13)*Pi*cot(sqrt(13/3)*Pi). - _Amiram Eldar_, Jan 26 2022
%F A101091 From _Elmo R. Oliveira_, Nov 09 2026: (Start)
%F A101091 a(n) = binomial(n+4,5)*(3*n^3 + 18*n^2 + 23*n - 2)/42.
%F A101091 E.g.f.: exp(x)*x*(7! + 9*7!*x + 686*5!*x^2 + 448*5!*x^3 + 2583*3!*x^4 + 1057*2!*x^5 + 22*3!*x^6 + 3*x^7) / 7!. (End)
%t A101091 Nest[Accumulate,Range[30]^4,4] (* _Harvey P. Dale_, Dec 30 2011 *)
